<title>FINLAND:  1996 PROFIT ECU 114 MLN VS 103 MLN.</title>
<headline>1996 PROFIT ECU 114 MLN VS 103 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December</p>
<p>31,</p>
<p>					     (million ECU unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 114 vs 103</p>
<p> Income from financial operations	     123 vs 119</p>
